WEBVTT

00:05:58.646 --> 00:06:02.108
And it is supporting the visions

00:06:02.108 --> 00:06:05.611
of intergenerational stewardship

00:06:05.611 --> 00:06:07.196
of Indigenous peoples.

00:06:08.114 --> 00:06:09.782
We have shown it's possible.

00:06:11.033 --> 00:06:13.619
Today, since 2017,

00:06:13.661 --> 00:06:16.705
Indigenous peoples, our partners,

00:06:16.747 --> 00:06:20.543
have advanced recognition
of their land rights and forests

00:06:20.584 --> 00:06:22.962
to up to 14 million hectares,

00:06:23.003 --> 00:06:26.715
benefitting seven million people
in 12 countries.

00:06:26.757 --> 00:06:29.844
And with TED’s Audacious support,

00:06:29.885 --> 00:06:32.596
we can leverage this momentum